            <ArticleTitle>Noncosmetic uses of botulinum toxin.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>187-95</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In conclusion, botulinum toxin usage over the past 2 to 3 decades has expanded exponentially. Almost every discipline in medicine has found some therapeutic use for this toxin. Botulinum toxin has been shown to be safe, effective, and relatively easy to administer with proper training.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
